This package bundles the official Plutonium launcher (plutonium.exe) downloaded from:
https://cdn.plutonium.pw/updater/plutonium.exe

Plutonium is a third-party mod launcher for select Call of Duty titles.
All trademarks are property of their respective owners.

The launcher is distributed as-is from the upstream site and may auto-update.
See https://plutonium.pw/ for documentation and terms.